  "result": "{\"object\": \"list\", \"results\": [{\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7827caad-6aee-41cd-885a-aca79b1e4856\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_1\", \"heading_1\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"十、程序路线（2026-05-21 核对官方须知）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"fe658495-712d-4e9f-8a11-62ed92260440\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"是否需要先调解/仲裁：不需要。民间借贷属普通合同纠纷，可直接起诉；借条未约定仲裁条款，无仲裁/调解前置（杭州法院立案须知①）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"eab684de-b906-4123-8b46-af9758b787b7\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"管辖法院：可在杭州市西湖区人民法院起诉，不必去宁波。被告住所地或合同履行地均可管辖；出借人主张返还借款，接收货币一方为出借人，其住所地为合同履行地（《民事诉讼法》第24条；《民间借贷司法解释》第2条；立案须知③；判例case_009）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"9a59518f-8a15-428b-89ab-eb71bc6613c5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"诉讼时效：三年（《民法典》第188条）。第一笔2024-06-10到期、第二笔2024-09-15到期；2025-02-15陈强还款2万元并承诺继续还，时效中断并重新计算（第195条），目前远未届满。但仍应尽快，因对方有处置房产迹象。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"97e36bb5-cef0-490b-81db-264fa1afcb86\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"流程：备齐证据→写起诉状（本金56万元+受保护利息）→向西湖区法院立案（线上或线下）→预交诉讼费→送达/举证/开庭→判决→15日内可上诉→生效后申请强制执行。财产保全可在起诉时或起诉前申请（《民事诉讼法》第103条）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"023d4eeb-9bcf-4537-8ee5-192cdde009bf\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"本案真正应先定的事：①第二笔20万元现金交付的证据能否补强；②是否申请财产保全（需王芳决定，涉及担保与错误保全赔偿风险）。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
}

