xt\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"LD-002 孙立（恒丰所）：律师执业证已被吊销，目前不得承办业务——无资格。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"69c10d8b-8424-4c29-8759-8eea45a42808\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"LD-003 李航（明理所）：只办刑事辩护、毒品犯罪，不承办民间借贷等民商事案件——专业不对口。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c7cf3e44-f4c6-493e-8110-2235a6cf791a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"LD-004 吴江（甬信所）：仅在宁波执业，杭州法院案件需另行委托当地律师——不符合“杭州能办”的底线。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"79cc5257-fda4-489d-8805-62dae346e0de\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"LD-005 郑霞（大公所）：仅计时收费¥1,200/时，预估50小时需预付¥60,000，不接受风险代理——超预算7倍以上。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"fe887931-b2fb-413d-8ecc-49e60029993c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"LD-007 冯涛（金诺所）：风险代理40%，超过民事财产案件30%的合规上限，超过部分约定无效——收费不合规。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7344e288-9186-4927-8611-986c30829f9c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"签约前必须问清（周敏或备选）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a6f36483-e549-4cb9-8a60-62d02c7b8cfa\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"¥4,000 是律师费还是代垫诉讼成本？诉讼费、保全担保费、保全保险费是否另计？\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"ea6c970c-6ceb-4c1b-8885-9fe06ebaea40\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"风险代理15%的计算基数是“实际回款”还是“判决金额”？是否含利息、诉讼费？\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"64734e9b-2bd6-41fa-8f7b-c0c2e7625b6b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"是否包含执行阶段？若一审后对方上诉，二审是否另收费？\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"253a4cf6-8dab-422e-832c-3de33cc18588\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"要求书面确认与陈强及其关联企业无利益冲突；签约前核对律师执业证原件与律所委托合同。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3d033ce4-d839-49e1-894a-fb8c2fac1da5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_1\", \"heading_1\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"十二、判例精读与开庭用法\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"f718ea1f-1030-4018-89dc-c898a0afef11\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_001（2025）浙0106民初13201号·西湖区：砍头息，借条50万实到48万，按48万认定本金——对应第一笔，主张36万；主动说明4万预扣，避免被对方突袭。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"850db176-2be1-478c-8a67-6612221af01d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_003（2025）浙0203民初07744号·海曙：25万现金只有借条、无取现/交付凭证，交付不成立，驳回——第二笔20万的反面教材，必须先补证。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3de70cba-4b6b-4402-842b-3c24ca09a0ee\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_012（2025）浙0203民初07120号·海曙：有取现凭证、能说明来源、有交易习惯，现金交付获支持——第二笔补证的方向：银行流水、现金来源、交付细节、证人。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a7e10973-60b8-4688-8cf7-33b6d61ca969\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_002（2025）浙0108民初09912号·滨江：月息3%超LPR四倍，仅四倍以内支持——利息按合同成立时LPR四倍分段主张，不按24%。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2b496ca2-36fb-46b6-8e32-f7e8c8fa8eb2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_007（2025）浙0108民初06012号·滨江：部分还款并承诺继续还，时效中断重新算三年；还款先抵利息后抵本金——对应2025-02-15的2万元，时效未过。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c2d964cf-7f1f-4d55-8f16-17578983023c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_004（2025）浙0106民初11876号·西湖区：未约定保证期间=主债务到期后6个月，未主张则免责——周国华2024-12-10后免责，不列被告。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"00a1a5dc-f84f-44dd-88ff-f0fefd2824e3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_006（2025）浙0106民初10044号·西湖区：大额借款用于赌博、配偶不认，不属夫妻共同债务——刘敏原则上不列共同被告。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"74307ac4-415f-4981-8d20-af4c4675c269\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_009（2025）浙0106民初09015号·西湖区：出借人住所地为合同履行地，驳回管辖异议——在西湖区起诉的依据。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"652803d1-a12d-4174-8ca3-a93feddde559\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"开庭三条主线\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"74c4cab9-89ba-4027-8e09-417db06f592d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"第一笔：借贷合意+36万到账，本金36万；4万是预扣利息，不是本金。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"53e5353e-f9f9-4a97-8f8f-b93465898da2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"第二笔：先补强现金来源与交付证据，庭审讲清取现/凑钱过程、交付时间地点、面额包装、在场人；否则按case_003有败诉风险。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5c2e59e6-cecd-47bf-815e-1ca8675e549c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"利息：按两笔合同成立时一年期LPR四倍分段计算（第一笔约14.6%，第二笔约13.8%，以核定为准），不主张24%。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
