区，身份证号、联系电话。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"28f732e8-1087-4b44-8c30-77270f1df1a0\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"被告信息：陈强，男，住宁波市海曙区，身份证号、联系电话（身份信息越完整越好）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"56afe9ae-2ba5-4601-84b2-934735ff8647\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"诉讼请求：①返还本金560,000元；②支付利息（第一笔36万自2023-06-10起按年14.6%、第二笔20万自2023-09-15起按年13.8%，均至实际清偿日，扣除已付20,000元）；③诉讼费、保全费由被告承担。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b1f0f46d-8173-4a8c-8484-83dc97c44925\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"事实与理由：两笔借款的合意、交付、到期、催收、2025-02-15部分还款并承诺（时效中断）、管辖依据。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5f3d7b44-f460-4e87-874e-6072a1174b07\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"证据和证据来源：按证据目录列明借条、回单、微信记录、邮件、账目等。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"cb4a2e4d-3e03-4d72-8605-fb39b240d5bf\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"此致杭州市西湖区人民法院；具状人签名、日期。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"22ed9ecf-4238-461b-819b-0ae229254681\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"二、立案材料清单\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5b2e7b4c-0b15-4b3e-83ce-9edfb82472c9\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"✅ 起诉状（待起草；一般一式三份：法院、被告、自留，以窗口要求为准）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"8f2bd5aa-1aaa-49ff-8fe3-d90be1644142\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"✅ 原告身份证复印件（原件备查）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"01c07cbf-3f32-45b4-8d3e-796e4e749ccb\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⚠️ 被告陈强身份信息：目前只有姓名、宁波海曙住址和邮箱，缺身份证号/户籍信息——网上立案可能卡住，需补。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b08dadda-bd6e-48e5-8f97-a3e93ba23b8d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"✅ 证据材料：两张借条、36万工行回单、微信催收与还款记录、2025-09-01催款邮件、店铺账目。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"be5657ca-e92b-4e3d-81f5-87bacb212922\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⚠️ 证据目录：待按E1-E11编号、页数、证明目的排版；一式三份。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7ff1442a-869e-4980-8bd1-8e5cf1c703a3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⚠️ 送达地址确认书：立案时填写（法院提供模板）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7fb239cc-26cc-4bad-8cd7-a87da14ee637\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⚠️ 授权委托书、律所函、律师证复印件：如委托周敏律师，由律所准备。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c9265241-6b63-45c7-8574-214448abd528\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⚠️ 保全材料（如申请）：保全申请书、担保（保险保函/现金/房产）、房产线索、保全费。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"fbe841eb-457e-4ce4-8a43-9685977bc080\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"三、诉讼费\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"1e6612ae-33b4-4d0f-8ba6-f0bc81c627e4\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"按诉请金额约76.94万估算，受理费约¥11,494，原告立案时先预交，审结后由败诉方负担。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"58733cf4-e943-4894-8f22-f5c069ca4566\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"若只按本金56万起诉、利息另计，受理费约¥9,400；利息计入诉请则按总额计费。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5ea735b5-8e33-48e1-81a0-90d7b1a213fb\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"经济困难可咨询法院是否可申请缓交/减交诉讼费，需符合条件并提供材料，不当然批准。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"d23be1ee-555a-4edd-8440-a2e09f14b737\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"四、还缺什么（按紧急程度）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"58d5f50d-9f60-49d1-8822-1aac970fa97a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"陈强的身份证号/户籍信息——最急，没有可能立不了案；可问老同学、查合同/转账实名信息，或由律师申请调查令。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"cef20fd2-e86d-4188-816e-c6709c766a68\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2023-06至2023-10银行流水——补第二笔20万现金来源。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3ac2a4ad-e074-4a58-8e5f-d8453b7750fc\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"微信转账电子凭证+原始手机——固定2万元还款和“剩下的我会还”。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"829414ad-f9c3-44df-8cb8-4d6ef1bc0547\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"房产挂牌截图——保全必要性；同时决定是否申请保全。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2dab3a61-cec3-480c-8f59-f271a1c0cbaa\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"律师委托手续——先定周敏，再出授权委托书。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5909e6e0-8ff4-480a-8edc-00ca0b0f4bbc\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"起诉状+证据目录——我可以先起草，提交前给你确认。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"774481cd-da68-4c7f-84aa-a0985ef89d71\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"诉讼费约¥11,494——提前准备，立案时可能要预交。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
}

