方主张一致。当庭确认本金36万，4万是预扣利息，不计入本金（民法典第670条）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2ab3be25-199f-4e8e-85b3-364f0da5789d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"双方约定月息2%：确认约定存在，但超过LPR四倍部分不受保护；我方已主动按四倍主张，不要求24%。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"725e1d84-4f02-4df1-8ee0-dd85f6869f64\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2025-02-15收到2万元：确认收到，但依司法解释第27条先抵利息、再抵本金。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"241f26b9-fd0a-4ae7-8544-f620de0f2010\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"二、必须反驳\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"d1300782-c08c-4256-8a02-d0de9c4dbd91\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"“20万现金没有交付”：借条写“今借到王芳人民币贰拾